        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Example 5 in Figure H.9 shows two separate vehicle sub-CA2 certificates; one is signed by the OEM root CA certificate while the other is signed by the V2G root CA certificate chain. Both of them have the same exact public/private key pair.",
