        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In some cases that would mean EVCC providing the vehicle sub-CA2 certificate signed by OEM root CA certificate while in others it would provide the vehicle sub-CA2 certificate signed by V2G root CA certificate.",
