        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Any sub-CA used to derive/generate vehicle certificate should be signed/cross-signed by a V2G root CA certificate. This ensures that the SECC will be able to verify the vehicle certificate even if it does not have the OEM root CA certificate.",
